Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,From Berlin to Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better start talking right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate number FE-40536,\Nfull name Jolene Cujoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.98,0:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the second time\Nyou've caused us a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.98,0:00:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time was a failed\Nescape attempt, and this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a dead female prisoner in the\Ncrypt with a bleeding crater in her skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd call that unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, somehow you have the balls to\Nremain silent and throw us attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Deadly accidents and severe injuries seem\Nto follow you around like a bad fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't prove you're behind them,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't escape that\Ncriminal reputation of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So from now on, you're gonna\Nlearn how to play by our rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Term length pending.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get used to this ultra security\Nhouse suit and it's your new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! Shit! Oh shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A chick is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure smells female, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The scent is rising from the\Nfloor like a Thanksgiving dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I threw some shit on her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman's face and my\Nshit touched each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The one thing I can't let happen\Nis the loss of mental strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stay strong and focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress kills your stamina!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an objective that I have\Nto achieve here at this unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get it done no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But the only way it's\Ngoing to happen is if I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,don't let myself surrender\Nto useless exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I'll only become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone wished to go\Nto heaven, there may be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,a way hey don't look at\Nme that way it's not like
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to wither\Nand die this heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,pertains to our spirits\Nand where they go after
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,death as your spirit evolves\Nso too does your power
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,where they ultimately\Nend up is what fascinates
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, I mean that place\Nwhere they go. Surely you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,of all people understand\Nwhat i'm talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,within that place lies real true happiness\Nif you can actually reach heaven that is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,though i'm aware joy cannot be found by
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,having an invincible\Nbody vast riches or even
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,reigning over all humanity\Nin the end the true
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,winner is the one who\Ngets to witness heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,offering whatever sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go there one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why I don't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm holding my hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I run away from the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's come through the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is the survival day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.52,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We tell me, you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.74,0:05:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up, but long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, for example, I'll\Nput a sticker on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It splits in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my particular power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.62,0:06:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called smack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I peel the sticker off, the pen will\Nrevert back to its original single form,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can destroy it by cracking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I accept this power as a\Nrevelation from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Smack is my license, my\Ngreen light for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I take\Nthis beautiful flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I've\Nrecently come to like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By all means, it's yours, Sports Maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're cutting you in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're cutting in\Nfront of you, I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious they all look\Ndown on me and don't accept me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I just have to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait your turn, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that feels like a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't succeed by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to be accepted,\Nyou have to change. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I should just do the\Nopposite of what I've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Does coffee have a reverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, tea? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me explain what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aatro's body wants coffee right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means I'm gonna\Ndrink tea. Deliberately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eat rice instead of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of my right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold the spoon in my left and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how I'm gonna change\Nmyself, by flipping everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check this out, FF.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:08:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the scars from\Nwhen I took those bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They hurt like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just stuffed the holes with plankton,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so full recovery is up to your\Nown healing power. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jolene, what do you\Nthink is the opposite of pork?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, chicken or beef?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The opposite of pork is salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pigs are lazy bastards, unlike salmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They swim upstream like the\Ntotal badasses they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're cutting again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him disrespect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.77,0:08:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm flipping\Nthe script from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like letting more of\Nthem cut in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep it moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.26,0:08:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop cutting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all waiting in line here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.39,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, you trash whore!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You better take a step\Nback, swamp monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can fly right in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, dude's going FF. So slick! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you know\Nwhere Ermes has been?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen her around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for days, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chasing a guy? That Ermes? For real? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, every morning recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, pretty sure it happened the day\Nyou got those holes in your belly, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find Jolene anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a panic in the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad shit's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Best to just leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That prisoner Hermes is after.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what goes on here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you see fit\Nto rely on me, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough it up, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You know damn well this info\Nwasn't gonna come for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Call it a finder's fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll give you the\Nfriends and family discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Today in the early dawn hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,a body of a woman assumed\Nto be collateral damage
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,in a gang dispute was found\Nin the city river a local
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,florida paper from six\Nyears ago and exactly like
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,that quest girl said it\Nhappened gloria costello she's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,ermis's sister
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,for the past
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,few days i've been watching
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,your every move closely\Nand carefully just biding
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,my sweet time then in a\Nsurprising turn of events I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,saw you hanging around in\Nthe former prison cemetery,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.30,0:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You left some flowers there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the grave of some fellow gang\Nmember that died by electric chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.66,0:10:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I also saw you skulking\Naround in the workshop,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,making stuffed birds and\Nalligators of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Had a thug like you suddenly take an\Ninterest in crafts like taxidermy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.98,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I actually give a shit\Nabout and want to know for sure is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene and FF. Hey, Hermes.\NYou're looking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you some breakfast
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, that guy you've been following\Naround for days Who I'm following?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.58,0:11:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Sports Maximum Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,outside he's a big D gangster But\Nright now he's doing a hard time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,in the men's ward here How fascinating But\NI don't give a rat's ass. Wait, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the reason you were sent to Green Dolphin\Nwas for robbing a convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you go out of your way to cause an\Nincident so you'd purposefully get arrested?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to get revenge on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:12:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As payback for your sister,\NI know it. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's against the rules\Nhere to investigate people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but today I chose\Nto do the opposite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as Aramis said earlier, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got your own important\Nobjective here, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get revenge on him with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be your foster mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.46,0:12:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that day, Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you'd always put our\Nfamily first before anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes, we could really use your help\Naround this place, at least a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad's leaving us the restaurant i\Ncan't do this by myself i want us to do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,this together i don't give a shit about\Nthis place i'm getting out of here i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna go to college on a track and field\Nscholarship now butt out of my life
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop acting like my mother. Hermes,\Nwait! Where are you? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to hold that chunk\Nof wood there in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like a dog chews a bone, but\Nthe way a baby sucks on a Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She had no plans to\Nlook around that corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.42,0:14:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,nor would she have reported them anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the ones that move in\Ndarkness to those in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no way you could operate a\Nfunctioning restaurant in that trashy city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,while more than aware of the dangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,had no choice but to report\Nthem in order to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Defendant sports maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sentence of five years for tax\Nevasion and grievous bodily injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Only five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all he fucking gets?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If the witness is like that,\Nwe can't catch him by the tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A felony charge wouldn't stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He told those goons to kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All the evidence has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not fucking finished with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your memories intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gloria would be so pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting years for\Nthis chance. A place where I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,could get you alone and nobody\Nwill hear your screams but me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the one thing I couldn't\Nstop thinking about this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,whole time What this ordeal\Nmust have been like for Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.24,0:16:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is gonna be burned\Ninto your memory forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep me trapped in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know your prison term\Nends in about a year or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're outside, you'll\Nalways have a bodyguard on point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But here, you're my bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that. Like a glove. Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the rusty pipes in this prison aren't big
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,enough for a person to\Nfit comfortably inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But see, this does make a nice\Nimprov coffin, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that the sound of him falling down?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:16:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your last moments to think!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You threw glory into\Nthe sewage, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that, Dad got\Ndepressed and it made him sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So apologize to them when you\Nget to hell, Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can apologize with that\Nsphincter you call a mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just so you know, I put\None more sticker on the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider it the last nail in your coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's totally sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now feel free to scream your lungs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't stop. You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Try calling for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I bet the only ones who'd even be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,listening are just the\Nroaches and the rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're in the sewer too, shithead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream Sports Maximum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:18:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Those resurrecting from darkness,\NLimp Bizkit, rise and come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With the darkness, share\Nthe joy, Limp Bizkit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.07,0:18:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.16,0:18:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.40,0:18:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be Sports Maximum?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:18:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, my finger. It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get why I didn't\Nfrickin' see it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was definitely an\Nobject with weight and mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Snicker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, did we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it get demolished?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't count on that\Nguy becoming a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You got real quiet, dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up, rat got your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get crushed in the pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do dreams come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.06,0:19:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're literally\Nin shit up to your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,eyeballs and you ate so\Nmuch you drowned in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sports Maximum's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of this invisible thing\Nmeans that fucker's still in the pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And he didn't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's even bigger. Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it possibly be the stuffed\Nalligator from the workshop?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The first one was the birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it mean that the corpses are moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Can the powers of the invisible\Ncorpses actually shift and attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.36,0:21:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that shit snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to get out of\Nthe pipe by breaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.00,0:21:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene was worried about you and - Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,FF, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.94,0:21:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an enemy, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.56,0:21:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an alligator!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Demonic spirit is waiting on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes my leg! Hey, Ermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a stand attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sports' maximum tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,While I was rotting in lock-up,\Nhe became a stand-user!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.04,0:22:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already moving to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Put up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,my head is filled with hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.24,0:22:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering About my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Out all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.36,0:23:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a distant dreamer, dreaming for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
